#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:801
msgid ""
"These controls are live status indicators. Sitemap endpoints become LIVE "
"together when Yablonsky SEO owns public SEO authority; while another SEO "
"provider owns authority they remain in SHADOW mode."
msgstr ""
"Is táscairí stádais beo iad na rialuithe seo. Éiríonn críochphointí "
"léarscáile suímh BEO le chéile nuair a bhíonn Yablonsky SEO i seilbh údaráis "
"SEO phoiblí; fad atá soláthraí SEO eile i seilbh údaráis fanann siad i mód "
"SCÁTH."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:710
msgid ""
"These checks report local configuration and Yablonsky SEO contract evidence. "
"Rankings, citations, crawler visits and remote index coverage require "
"external evidence."
msgstr ""
"Tuairiscíonn na seiceálacha seo cumraíocht áitiúil agus fianaise conartha "
"Yablonsky SEO. Teastaíonn fianaise sheachtrach do ranguithe, luanna, "
"cuairteanna crawler agus clúdach innéacs cianda."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:501
msgid ""
"These controls reduce duplicate or unused WordPress surfaces. They start in "
"Standby. Keep every feed, REST or discovery surface that real users or "
"integrations depend on; ranking outcomes remain determined by external search"
" systems."
msgstr ""
"Laghdaíonn na rialuithe seo dromchlaí WordPress dúblacha nó neamhúsáidte. "
"Tosaíonn siad i bhFuireachas. Coinnigh gach dromchla fotha, REST nó aimsithe "
"a mbraitheann úsáideoirí fíora nó comhtháthuithe air; fanann torthaí "
"rangúcháin faoi chinneadh córais chuardaigh sheachtracha."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:683
msgid ""
"These preferences affect only explicit Yablonsky AI generation. Local SEO, "
"AEO and GEO analysis remains unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ní théann na sainroghanna seo i bhfeidhm ach ar ghiniúint shainráite "
"Yablonsky AI. Fanann anailís áitiúil SEO, AEO agus GEO gan athrú."

#: src/Discovery/DiscoverySettings.php:247
msgid ""
"Third-party/custom taxonomy: excluded until its search value is explicitly "
