msgstr ""
"Tacsanomaíocht tríú páirtí/saincheaptha: eisiata go dtí go ndeimhnítear a "
"luach cuardaigh go sainráite."

#: src/Discovery/DiscoveryAdminController.php:183
msgid ""
"This catalog is large enough that cache/origin delivery matters. Yablonsky "
"Performance can add acceleration, while Commerce Feeds works independently."
msgstr ""
"Tá an chatalóg seo mór go leor go bhfuil seachadadh taisce/bunúis "
"tábhachtach. Is féidir le Yablonsky Performance luasghéarú a chur leis, agus "
"oibríonn Commerce Feeds go neamhspleách."

#: src/Analysis/ContentOptimizationAnalyzer.php:341
msgid ""
"This content is explicitly set to noindex, so search optimization readiness "
"is intentionally capped."
msgstr ""
"Tá noindex socraithe go sainráite don ábhar seo, mar sin tá ullmhacht "
"optamaithe cuardaigh teoranta d'aon ghnó."

#: src/SEO/Redirects/RedirectController.php:47
