#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:582
msgid ""
"When FAQPage is selected, flag obviously weak visible FAQ evidence. FAQPage "
"selection remains editor-controlled and evidence-led."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a roghnaítear FAQPage, brataigh fianaise FAQ infheicthe atá soiléir "
"lag. Fanann roghnú FAQPage faoi rialú an eagarthóra agus faoi threoir "
"fianaise."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:808
msgid ""
"When Yablonsky SEO owns authority, membership is materialized locally and "
"updated on content/meta events. In Shadow mode background sitemap indexing is"
" paused. Old ready-state buckets stay cold; only affected buckets and the "
"root manifest are invalidated."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn Yablonsky SEO i seilbh údaráis, ábharítear ballraíocht go "
"háitiúil agus nuashonraítear í ar imeachtaí ábhair/meitea. I mód Scátha "
"cuirtear innéacsú léarscáile suímh cúlra ar sos. Fanann sean-bhuicéid staid-"
"réidh fuar; ní neamhbhailítear ach buicéid atá buailte agus an manifest "
"fréimhe."

#: src/Admin/SeoEditorController.php:648
msgid ""
"When Yablonsky SEO owns public authority, expose root /llms.txt plus clean "
".md alternates for public resources. HTML remains canonical and Markdown "
"responses are noindex."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhíonn Yablonsky SEO i seilbh údaráis phoiblí, nocht /llms.txt "
"fréimhe móide malairtí glana .md d'acmhainní poiblí. Fanann HTML canónach "
"agus tá freagraí Markdown noindex."

#: src/Admin/AdminController.php:763
msgid ""
"When a published post/page/product or public taxonomy term moves to a new "
"URL, YSEO records a 301 from the previous path to the new canonical URL."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bhogann postáil/leathanach/táirge foilsithe nó téarma tacsanomaíochta"
" poiblí chuig URL nua, taifeadann YSEO 301 ón gcosán roimhe seo chuig an URL "
"canónach nua."

